#: kstart.cpp:255
msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Eşlätäse boyırıq"

#: kstart.cpp:257
msgid "A regular expression matching the window title"
msgstr "Tärtip çağılışı bu täräzä başlığına kileşte"

#: kstart.cpp:258
msgid ""
"A string matching the window class (WM_CLASS property)\n"
"The window class can be found out by running\n"
"'xprop | grep WM_CLASS' and clicking on a window\n"
"(use either both parts separated by a space or only the right part).\n"
"NOTE: If you specify neither window title nor window class,\n"
"then the very first window to appear will be taken;\n"
"omitting both options is NOT recommended."
msgstr ""
"Bu täräzä sínıfına kileşkän yul (WM_CLASS üzençälege)\n"
"Bu täräzä sínıfın tabu öçen, 'xprop | grep WM_CLASS'\n"
"boyırığın cibärüdän soñ şul täräzägä çirtäse.\n"
"BELDERÜ: Täräzäneñ başlığı da, sínıfı da äytelmägän bulsa,\n"
"berençe kürengän täräzä alınaçaq, şuña kürä bu köylämäneñ\n"
"ikesen dä kermiçä qaldırırğa kiñäş itelmi."

#: kstart.cpp:265
msgid "Desktop on which to make the window appear"
msgstr "Bu täräzä kürenäçäk östäl"

#: kstart.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application"
msgstr ""
"Bu täräzäne, yazılım cibärelgändä qullanılğan östäldä\n"
"kürenerlek itäse"

#: kstart.cpp:267
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "Bu täräzäne bar öställärdä kürenerlek itäse"

#: kstart.cpp:268
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "Täräzäne tamğağa tör"

#: kstart.cpp:269
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "Cäyep quy"

#: kstart.cpp:270
msgid "Maximize the window vertically"
msgstr "Cäyep quy, Buyğa"

#: kstart.cpp:271
msgid "Maximize the window horizontally"
msgstr "Cäyep quy, Arqılığa"

#: kstart.cpp:272
msgid "Show window fullscreen"
msgstr "Täräzäne cäyep kürsätü"

#: kstart.cpp:273
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog, TopMenu or Override"
msgstr ""
"Täräzä törläre: Töp/Normal, Östäl/Desktop,\n"
"Berketmäle/Dock, Qoral/Tool, Saylaq/Menu,\n"
"Dialog, SaylaqTirä/TopMenu, Qaplawlı/Override"

#: kstart.cpp:274
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"Täräzä başqa östäldä cibärelgän bulsa da\n"
"aña barıber küçäse."

#: kstart.cpp:277
msgid "Try to keep the window above other windows"
msgstr "Bu täräzäne başqalar östendä totıp qarísı"

#: kstart.cpp:279
msgid "Try to keep the window below other windows"
msgstr "Bu täräzäne başqalar astında totıp qarísı"

#: kstart.cpp:280
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "Bu täräzä yöktiräneñ keremen almí"

#: kstart.cpp:281
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "Bu täräzä bitçe keremen almí"

#: kstart.cpp:282
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker"
msgstr "Bu täräzä yöktiräneñ sistem ulağına küçerelä"

#: kstart.cpp:289
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "KStart"

#: kstart.cpp:290
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"Yazılımnarnı bu qoral aşa cibärep täräzä üzençäleklären köyläp \n"
"bula, alar arasında: törelgän, cäyelgän, berär östäldä b.b."

#: kstart.cpp:310
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "Boyırıq birelmäde"

